   "_about": "SOBEKTUNE v1: gates for a character whose body is not Joan-sized. Each factor multiplies a Joan-scale limit (footFloorMaxM, armClearanceMeshMinM) for THAT character only; no factor = 1.0. Factors are measured from the bound rigs at rest (SOBEKTUNE measure_scale.py: Sobek / roster player): foot length (Foot->ToeBase) 0.309 / 0.169 = 1.83; hips height 1.267 / 0.990 = 1.28 (mesh clearance follows body bulk, not arm length: arm length is 2.13x but would hide real contact). A scale is not a waiver: the sink side of G-plant uses the same factor and the toes still must not go below 0.05 x 1.83 m. armRestSeparationM (SOBEKTUNE v1) = the arm clearance gate only counts arm verts that are at least this far from the torso at rest: the weight-boundary verts touch the torso in the T-pose (0.002 m) and would fail any pose.",
